        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the beginning there was nothing,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >suddenly , a spark of hope in utter darkness..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Crossing immense space and time , light began to describe wholeness of the space eternal..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >creating what appears to be some kind of geometry divided in eight quadrants of eternal space..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >endless beams of light, carrying life with them ..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >soon the eternal space was teeming with life..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eridanus , the dark  river flows between the quadrants, keeping them united and separated simultaneously..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Suddenly ,Phaeton , the &quot;Dark star&quot;, fell into the river igniting the separation between quadrants..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that point Eridanus started flooding quadrants of space ..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from its depths , alien species , the &quot;Distorts&quot;, emerged..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Technologically advanced they quickly conquered intergalactically quadrants of space.. galaxy after galaxy..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >destroying everything in its path..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life forms had to flee before the eternal darkness..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historians, eternal beings who were there from the beginning made sure that every life form had its chance to flee before it get caught by the waves of Eridanus..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is our story..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Year 2061, mankind finally touched the surface of the red planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our probes were sending data of the site of unknown origin in the northern hemisphere of Mars for decades.. and emitting data of big magnetic disturbances in surrounding area..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Substance, latter called &quot;Octium&quot; because of its omni-potency in bending and traversing space and time was found soon upon Mars landing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mankind officially became interstellar species in the year 2091..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With knowledge gathered from those journeys mankind also left the trails of their visits that ultimately led them to us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as simulated subject [G]..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little droid called Trace is a small but powerful companion so you are not completely alone on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The only thing Avatar remembered was the sound of the ultra high-end stereo fields and undiscovered songs in the back of his mind!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indulge in this fast paced action shooter with puzzle elements..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need unleast two Octium crystals to pass the portal..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fly, drive, upgrade your weapons, upgrade your droid companion and unlock multiple endings..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the beginning there was nothing,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >suddenly , a spark of hope in utter darkness..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Crossing immense space and time , light began to describe wholeness of the space eternal..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >creating what appears to be some kind of geometry divided in eight quadrants of eternal space..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >endless beams of light, carrying life with them ..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >soon the eternal space was teeming with life..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eridanus , the dark  river flows between the quadrants, keeping them united and separated simultaneously..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Suddenly ,Phaeton , the &quot;Dark star&quot;, fell into the river igniting the separation between quadrants..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that point Eridanus started flooding quadrants of space ..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from its depths , alien species , the &quot;Distorts&quot;, emerged..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Technologically advanced they quickly conquered intergalactically quadrants of space.. galaxy after galaxy..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >destroying everything in its path..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life forms had to flee before the eternal darkness..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historians, eternal beings who were there from the beginning made sure that every life form had its chance to flee before it get caught by the waves of Eridanus..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is our story..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Year 2061, mankind finally touched the surface of the red planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our probes were sending data of the site of unknown origin in the northern hemisphere of Mars for decades.. and emitting data of big magnetic disturbances in surrounding area..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Substance, latter called &quot;Octium&quot; because of its omni-potency in bending and traversing space and time was found soon upon Mars landing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mankind officially became interstellar species in the year 2091..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With knowledge gathered from those journeys mankind also left the trails of their visits that ultimately led them to us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as simulated subject [G]..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little droid called Trace is a small but powerful companion so you are not completely alone on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The only thing Avatar remembered was the sound of the ultra high-end stereo fields and undiscovered songs in the back of his mind!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indulge in this fast paced action shooter with puzzle elements..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need unleast two Octium crystals to pass the portal..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fly, drive, upgrade your weapons, upgrade your droid companion and unlock multiple endings..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Explore this post apocalyptic semi-open world and the aftermath of an alien encounter. Play as simulated subject &quot;G&quot;.Upgrade your weapons, find your way through the enemies, find the way to the main ship and save the crew. Humankind must leave the solar system! Something big is coming!",
